                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Worse than original Holopoint.\nIt's hard to enjoy a fast-paced archery game at sub 90 FPS.\n\nPros:\n-More enemies.\n-More areas.\n\nCons:\n-Terrible performance. It couldn't run at 90 FPS with Vive Pro + i7-6700K + RTX 2080 (100% supersampling). After adjusting the supersampling to around 70% and the quality to medium, it could barely run at 90 FPS (with Motion Smoothing off).\n-Terrible UI. It's hard to understand the icons.\n-It's hard to see enemies in some bright areas.\n-The \"spotlights\" are too conspicuous and a bit unsightly.",
